{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"title","type":"text","x":0,"y":-310,"width":2840,"height":240,"text":"# Shell、数据整理与命令行环境\n\n[[03_Computer_Science/99_Miscellaneous/Shell与数据管道|从五条日志连续阅读]] · [[03_Computer_Science/99_Miscellaneous/the_missing_semester|逐讲解释与练习]] · [[知识原子.base|定义入口]]\n\n由上到下：解释命令 → 保留参数 → 处理数据 → 固定执行环境 → 管理任务 → 跨越机器。各区从左向右阅读；连线只表达标明的关系，不表示掌握度。"},
		{"id":"commands","type":"group","x":-40,"y":0,"width":2880,"height":720,"label":"1 · 命令与数据流：谁解释，谁接收","color":"4"},
		{"id":"shell","type":"text","x":0,"y":100,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[Shell]]\n\n解释命令；并非每条命令都是外部程序。"},
		{"id":"simple","type":"text","x":580,"y":100,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[Shell简单命令]]\n\n区分赋值、命令词、参数和重定向。"},
		{"id":"lookup","type":"text","x":1160,"y":100,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[Shell命令查找]]\n\n函数、内建与外部程序；PATH 不是全部。"},
		{"id":"path","type":"text","x":1740,"y":100,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[文件路径]]\n\n绝对或相对路径逐级定位文件系统对象。"},
		{"id":"permission","type":"text","x":2320,"y":100,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[Unix权限位]]\n\n文件执行与目录搜索不是同一种权限含义。"},
		{"id":"streams","type":"text","x":0,"y":450,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[标准流]]\n\n标准输入、输出、错误对应 fd 0、1、2。"},
		{"id":"redir","type":"text","x":580,"y":450,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[Shell重定向]]\n\n在执行前改变文件描述符的连接。"},
		{"id":"redirorder","type":"text","x":1160,"y":450,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[重定向顺序]]\n\n复制描述符取决于执行到该处时的连接。"},
		{"id":"pipeline","type":"text","x":1740,"y":450,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[Shell管道]]\n\n将 stdout 接到下一段 stdin；传字节，不传 argv。"},
		{"id":"exit","type":"text","x":2320,"y":450,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[命令退出状态]]\n\n按命令契约解释整数结果；零用于成功路径。"},
		{"id":"arguments","type":"group","x":-40,"y":850,"width":2880,"height":720,"label":"2 · 参数边界：展开后仍然传对对象","color":"5"},
		{"id":"quote","type":"text","x":0,"y":950,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[Shell引用]]\n\n按引用方式保留字面字符或保护展开结果。"},
		{"id":"split","type":"text","x":580,"y":950,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[Shell字段分割]]\n\n适用的未引用展开按 IFS 分成字段。"},
		{"id":"glob","type":"text","x":1160,"y":950,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[Shell文件名展开]]\n\n模式匹配实际路径名；不是正则表达式。"},
		{"id":"brace","type":"text","x":1740,"y":950,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[Bash大括号展开]]\n\n先生成文字备选，不要求对应文件存在。"},
		{"id":"positional","type":"text","x":2320,"y":950,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[Shell位置参数]]\n\n用 \"$@\" 分别保留各参数，包括空参数。"},
		{"id":"command-sub","type":"text","x":0,"y":1300,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[命令替换]]\n\n捕获 stdout 文本，并删除尾部换行。"},
		{"id":"process-sub","type":"text","x":580,"y":1300,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[进程替换]]\n\n提供流的访问路径；不是普通临时文件保证。"},
		{"id":"safe-argv","type":"text","x":1160,"y":1300,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[文件名安全传参]]\n\n同时保护分隔边界与程序的选项边界。"},
		{"id":"text","type":"group","x":-40,"y":1700,"width":2880,"height":1070,"label":"3 · 文本管道：格式、选择、变换与计数","color":"6"},
		{"id":"wrangling","type":"text","x":0,"y":1800,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[数据整理]]\n\n围绕明确结果转换、检查和组织输入数据。"},
		{"id":"regex","type":"text","x":580,"y":1800,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[正则表达式]]\n\n用模式描述要匹配的字符序列。"},
		{"id":"dialect","type":"text","x":1160,"y":1800,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[正则方言边界]]\n\nBRE、ERE、固定字符串和具体实现须区分。"},
		{"id":"greedy","type":"text","x":1740,"y":1800,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[贪婪匹配跨越分隔符]]\n\n宽泛重复可能跨过本来要保留的分隔符。"},
		{"id":"sed","type":"text","x":2320,"y":1800,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[sed替换]]\n\n按匹配位置与次数规则替换文本。"},
		{"id":"grep","type":"text","x":0,"y":2150,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[grep行筛选]]\n\n默认输出符合模式的整行。"},
		{"id":"grep-status","type":"text","x":580,"y":2150,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[grep退出状态]]\n\n无匹配与工具错误分别解释。"},
		{"id":"awk","type":"text","x":1160,"y":2150,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[awk文本处理]]\n\n对记录应用模式—动作规则并访问字段。"},
		{"id":"parse","type":"text","x":1740,"y":2150,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[字段切分不等于格式解析]]\n\nCSV 引号和 JSON 结构不是通用列号能解释的。"},
		{"id":"aggregate","type":"text","x":2320,"y":2150,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[awk条件聚合]]\n\n检查记录并累计状态，在 END 输出结果。"},
		{"id":"sort","type":"text","x":0,"y":2500,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[文本排序键选择]]\n\n明确比较键、数值方式及并列行为。"},
		{"id":"uniq","type":"text","x":580,"y":2500,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[相邻行去重]]\n\n只合并相邻相同行；未排序可能分成多组。"},
		{"id":"frequency","type":"text","x":1160,"y":2500,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[排序分组频数统计]]\n\n按完整值排序分组计数，再确定展示顺序。"},
		{"id":"locale","type":"text","x":1740,"y":2500,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[文本处理的locale边界]]\n\n字符、排序与数值解释受 locale 约定影响。"},
		{"id":"execution","type":"group","x":-40,"y":2900,"width":2880,"height":1070,"label":"4 · 可重复执行：控制、脚本与配置","color":"3"},
		{"id":"conditional","type":"text","x":0,"y":3000,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[Shell条件执行]]\n\n按退出状态选择后续命令；&& 与 || 不是通用三元式。"},
		{"id":"pipe-status","type":"text","x":580,"y":3000,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[管道退出状态]]\n\n默认取末段；pipefail 按非零状态规则聚合。"},
		{"id":"function","type":"text","x":1160,"y":3000,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[Shell函数]]\n\n给命令组命名；执行环境取决于调用上下文。"},
		{"id":"script","type":"text","x":1740,"y":3000,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[Shell脚本]]\n\n由指定 Shell 读取解释的命令文件。"},
		{"id":"source","type":"text","x":2320,"y":3000,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[脚本执行与载入]]\n\n子解释器执行与在当前 Shell 载入改变不同状态。"},
		{"id":"shebang","type":"text","x":0,"y":3350,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[Shebang]]\n\n直接执行时选择解释器；显式调用解释器另论。"},
		{"id":"alias","type":"text","x":580,"y":3350,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[Shell别名]]\n\n读取命令时的文本替换，不是通用函数。"},
		{"id":"temp","type":"text","x":1160,"y":3350,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[临时目录安全创建]]\n\n先成功创建私有目录，再在其中准备候选结果。"},
		{"id":"idempotent","type":"text","x":1740,"y":3350,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[脚本幂等性]]\n\n在指定状态与假设下，重复应用等效于一次。"},
		{"id":"env","type":"text","x":2320,"y":3350,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[环境变量]]\n\n进程环境中的名称—字符串值条目，不是全局实时表。"},
		{"id":"export","type":"text","x":0,"y":3700,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[环境变量导出]]\n\n将变量放入后续外部命令的环境。"},
		{"id":"startup","type":"text","x":580,"y":3700,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[Bash启动文件选择]]\n\n交互、登录与调用方式决定读取哪些配置。"},
		{"id":"dotfiles","type":"text","x":1160,"y":3700,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[dotfiles]]\n\n工具读取的用户配置文件；不等于所有隐藏文件。"},
		{"id":"dotfiles-manage","type":"text","x":1740,"y":3700,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[dotfiles配置管理]]\n\n版本化已审查配置，明确安装、机器差异和秘密边界。"},
		{"id":"jobs","type":"group","x":-40,"y":4100,"width":2880,"height":720,"label":"5 · 任务生命周期：运行、请求与完成证据","color":"2"},
		{"id":"process","type":"text","x":0,"y":4200,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[Unix进程]]\n\n程序的执行实例，带有进程身份与运行状态。"},
		{"id":"job","type":"text","x":580,"y":4200,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[Shell作业]]\n\nShell 管理的相关进程集合，例如一个管道。"},
		{"id":"fgbg","type":"text","x":1160,"y":4200,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[前台与后台作业]]\n\n终端交互与等待方式，不是是否正在计算。"},
		{"id":"job-switch","type":"text","x":1740,"y":4200,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[作业状态切换]]\n\n暂停、恢复前台或后台，各改变明确状态。"},
		{"id":"signal","type":"text","x":2320,"y":4200,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[Unix信号]]\n\n传递事件或请求；处理行为按信号与进程而定。"},
		{"id":"terminate","type":"text","x":0,"y":4550,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[正常终止与强制终止]]\n\n请求清理与不可捕获的强制结束须分开。"},
		{"id":"wait","type":"text","x":580,"y":4550,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[等待子进程]]\n\n等待当前 Shell 可管理的子任务并取得状态。"},
		{"id":"disconnect","type":"text","x":1160,"y":4550,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[后台作业断连边界]]\n\n后台运行本身不提供断连存活保证。"},
		{"id":"mux","type":"text","x":1740,"y":4550,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[终端复用]]\n\n在一个连接中组织多个交互终端。"},
		{"id":"tmux-bound","type":"text","x":2320,"y":4550,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[tmux会话保持边界]]\n\n重连需服务端与会话存在且可访问；任务状态另查。"},
		{"id":"remote","type":"group","x":-40,"y":4950,"width":2880,"height":450,"label":"6 · 远程边界：在哪执行，认证谁，连接哪端","color":"1"},
		{"id":"ssh","type":"text","x":0,"y":5050,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[SSH远程执行]]\n\n明确本地与远端 Shell 的解释位置。"},
		{"id":"host-auth","type":"text","x":580,"y":5050,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[SSH主机认证]]\n\n验证服务器的身份，警惕未经验证的密钥变化。"},
		{"id":"user-auth","type":"text","x":1160,"y":5050,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[SSH公钥认证]]\n\n服务器用已授权公钥验证用户持有对应私钥。"},
		{"id":"forward","type":"text","x":1740,"y":5050,"width":420,"height":170,"text":"## [[SSH本地端口转发]]\n\n区分本地监听、SSH 服务器和远端目标。"},
		{"id":"remote-example","type":"text","x":2320,"y":5050,"width":420,"height":230,"text":"## 一个连接，三处地址\n\n浏览器 → 本地监听端 → SSH 服务器 → 目标服务\n\n[[SSH本地端口转发|目标 localhost 从服务器一端解释]]。"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"e1","fromNode":"shell","toNode":"simple","fromSide":"right","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"解释语法"},
		{"id":"e2","fromNode":"simple","toNode":"lookup","fromSide":"right","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"确定命令"},
		{"id":"e3","fromNode":"lookup","toNode":"path","fromSide":"right","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"外部路径"},
		{"id":"e4","fromNode":"path","toNode":"permission","fromSide":"right","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"核对访问"},
		{"id":"e5","fromNode":"streams","toNode":"redir","fromSide":"right","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"改变连接"},
		{"id":"e6","fromNode":"redir","toNode":"redirorder","fromSide":"right","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"顺序有义"},
		{"id":"e7","fromNode":"quote","toNode":"split","fromSide":"right","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"限制分割"},
		{"id":"e8","fromNode":"split","toNode":"glob","fromSide":"right","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"适用时再展"},
		{"id":"e9","fromNode":"quote","toNode":"command-sub","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow","label":"引用捕获值"},
		{"id":"e10","fromNode":"glob","toNode":"safe-argv","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow","label":"保护文件名"},
		{"id":"e11","fromNode":"regex","toNode":"dialect","fromSide":"right","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"指定语言"},
		{"id":"e12","fromNode":"dialect","toNode":"greedy","fromSide":"right","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"核对重复"},
		{"id":"e13","fromNode":"greedy","toNode":"sed","fromSide":"right","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"检查删取"},
		{"id":"e14","fromNode":"grep","toNode":"grep-status","fromSide":"right","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"区分无匹配"},
		{"id":"e15","fromNode":"awk","toNode":"parse","fromSide":"right","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"格式边界"},
		{"id":"e16","fromNode":"parse","toNode":"aggregate","fromSide":"right","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"先定契约"},
		{"id":"e17","fromNode":"sort","toNode":"uniq","fromSide":"right","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"按去重契约归组"},
		{"id":"e18","fromNode":"uniq","toNode":"frequency","fromSide":"right","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"计数后排序"},
		{"id":"e19","fromNode":"frequency","toNode":"locale","fromSide":"right","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"核对各阶段规则"},
		{"id":"e20","fromNode":"conditional","toNode":"pipe-status","fromSide":"right","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"按整体状态"},
		{"id":"e21","fromNode":"function","toNode":"script","fromSide":"right","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"两种封装"},
		{"id":"e22","fromNode":"script","toNode":"source","fromSide":"right","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"决定执行处"},
		{"id":"e23","fromNode":"export","toNode":"startup","fromSide":"right","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"配置生效处"},
		{"id":"e24","fromNode":"startup","toNode":"dotfiles","fromSide":"right","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"配置载体"},
		{"id":"e35","fromNode":"dotfiles","toNode":"dotfiles-manage","fromSide":"right","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"版本化安装"},
		{"id":"e25","fromNode":"process","toNode":"job","fromSide":"right","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"按作业组织"},
		{"id":"e26","fromNode":"job","toNode":"fgbg","fromSide":"right","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"终端归属"},
		{"id":"e27","fromNode":"fgbg","toNode":"job-switch","fromSide":"right","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"切换状态"},
		{"id":"e28","fromNode":"job-switch","toNode":"signal","fromSide":"right","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"发送请求"},
		{"id":"e29","fromNode":"terminate","toNode":"wait","fromSide":"right","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"再取完成证据"},
		{"id":"e30","fromNode":"fgbg","toNode":"disconnect","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow","label":"不保证存活"},
		{"id":"e31","fromNode":"mux","toNode":"tmux-bound","fromSide":"right","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"存活条件"},
		{"id":"e32","fromNode":"ssh","toNode":"host-auth","fromSide":"right","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"先识别服务端"},
		{"id":"e33","fromNode":"host-auth","toNode":"user-auth","fromSide":"right","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"另验用户"},
		{"id":"e34","fromNode":"forward","toNode":"remote-example","fromSide":"right","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"标明位置"}
	]
}
